; ============================================================
; THE BYZANTINE SHADOW
; RUNTIME MODULE ORCHESTRATOR
; ============================================================
;
; Purpose:
;   Canonical module loader for the Byzantine Shadow runtime package.
;
; Runtime layout:
;   /ai/ShadowByzantine.per              root runtime entrypoint
;   /ai/ShadowByzantine/ShadowByzantine.per  module orchestrator
;   /ai/ShadowByzantine/*.per            runtime modules
;
; Design:
;   This file contains no behavioral rules. Its sole authority is
;   deterministic module inclusion and dependency ordering.
;
; Load-order contract:
;   01  Shadow constants / engine vocabulary
;   01b Byzantine ABI constants / state vocabulary
;   02  state observers
;   03  economy observers
;   04  construction lifecycle
;   05  composition policy
;   05  production policy / execution-facing production logic
;   06  military subsystem
;   07  placement subsystem
;   07  strategic reserve policy
;   08  construction requirements
;   09  capital feasibility
;   10  escrow lifecycle
;   11  construction authority
;   12  construction execution
;   13  world-state verification
;   14  recovery / reconciliation
;   15  reassessment
;
; The loader intentionally uses local module names. Because this file
; resides inside ShadowByzantine/, each load resolves against the same
; module directory rather than duplicating the directory prefix.
;
; Shadow-derived principle:
;   declarations precede consumers; observations precede policy gates;
;   feasibility precedes escrow; escrow precedes authority; authority
;   precedes execution; execution precedes verification; verification
;   precedes release/recovery and reassessment.
; ============================================================

; ------------------------------------------------------------
; FOUNDATION
; ------------------------------------------------------------
(load "01_constants")
(load "01b_byz_constants")
(load "02_state")
(load "03_economy")

; ------------------------------------------------------------
; STRATEGIC / CONSTRUCTION POLICY
; ------------------------------------------------------------
(load "04_construction")
(load "05_composition_policy")
(load "05_production")
(load "06_military")

; ------------------------------------------------------------
; PLACEMENT / RESOURCE / FEASIBILITY
; ------------------------------------------------------------
(load "07_placement")
(load "07_strategic reserve")
(load "08_requirements")
(load "09_capital")

; ------------------------------------------------------------
; TRANSACTION / EXECUTION PIPELINE
; ------------------------------------------------------------
(load "10_escrow")
(load "11_authority")
(load "12_execution")
(load "13_verification")
(load "14_recovery")
(load "15_reassessment")

; ============================================================
; END OF MODULE GRAPH
; ============================================================
